  "title": "Josefa L NDE 6326",
  "date": "1976",
  "content": "Some friends cut off my breathing by squeezing my chest and lungs. Very soon, I felt hot and found myself in what was a large passageway: more than a tunnel; at the end there was an enormous double door with a white light filtering through. The door opened and the light invaded me, surrounded me. On either side of the door there were rows of people (whom I did not recognize, they were rather indistinct), waiting for me, applauding me, I was engulfed in wellbeing. The feeling is indeed indescribable; it is pure happiness. My friends managed to bring me round, the return seemed violent. I did not see my body either when leaving it or when I returned, I think the time I was away was quite short, but I don't know any more about it.",
